{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Fokuso 是一款把專注時間變成 3D 小島的計時工具，適合容易分心、需要安靜節奏的學生與上班族。每完成一節專注，就能賺取 Pomo 佈置屬於自己的島嶼。程式沒有帳號、廣告與訂閱，所有記錄留在裝置上，亦可完全離線使用。原價 US $9.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>專注節奏與小島養成</h2>\n<p>Fokuso 提供 Timer、Pomodoro、Flow、Intervals 與 Open 五種計時模式，長度可設 1 至 480 分鐘，暫停不扣時間，亦可加 5 分鐘或提早結束，短時段同樣計入成果。十款現成儀式涵蓋學習、深度工作、閱讀與寫作，也可自訂回合與音景。每次專注可賺取 Pomo，用來解鎖 45 件手工建築、自然與燈光裝飾，把 3D 小島由 8×8 擴展至 24×24，並可拖拉、旋轉與更換擺設。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-208-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-209-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-210-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-211-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-212-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-213-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Fokuso: Focus Timer &amp; Pomodoro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T10:39:02.918311+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":413,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T10:24:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:57:46.112485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:37:38.895429+00:00","content_hash":"368d3ddcee3353ee5e599a0296abd9730e782e56ffb1bf773052404367719985","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}